OL,3,GNEWSAPolice continue to seek walking
OL,4,Aroute rape suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man previously arrested as part of a
OL,7,FTrans Pennine Trail rape inquiry has
OL,8,Fbeen released, police said, with
OL,9,Finvestigations into the attack
OL,10,Fcontinuing.
OL,12,FA woman was assaulted at about 14:50
OL,13,FGMT on 4 November between Mexborough
OL,14,FRoad and Harlington Road, near
OL,15,FBolton-upon-Dearne.
OL,17,FThe 53-year-old man, arrested on
OL,18,FThursday, faces no further action,
OL,19,FSouth Yorkshire Police said, with the
OL,20,Fvictim informed of the update.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
