OL,3,GNEWSAPolice continue to seek walking
OL,4,Aroute rape suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Helen Hughes, senior
OL,7,Finvestigating officer for the case,
OL,8,Fsaid: "Our priorities remain clear `
OL,9,Ffinding the person responsible and
OL,10,Fsecuring justice for the woman at the
OL,11,Fheart of this case."
